config-connector-extensions patch 0034: mockgcp's Service Usage knows every public Google API.

mockserviceusage refused to enable a service not on its short list
(knownservices.go) with 403, so enabling iam, logging, monitoring or
artifactregistry failed in the fake (found by the catalog's project
wrapper chart). Written here: knownservices_public.go adds the 306 services
of the pinned Discovery documents (docs/coverage/sources.yaml) to that
list; nothing else changes, and a name on neither list is still refused.
Upstream candidate: yes.

diff --git a/mockgcp/mockserviceusage/knownservices_public.go b/mockgcp/mockserviceusage/knownservices_public.go
new file mode 100644
--- /dev/null
+++ b/mockgcp/mockserviceusage/knownservices_public.go
@@ -0,0 +1,336 @@
